{"seq":3,"slug":"augmentation","title":"数据增强","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-centric-ai/curation/augmentation","wordCount":1588,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据增强\">数据增强</h1><p>当你只有 500 张猫的照片，却需要模型在各种光照、角度、遮挡下都认得出猫时，最便宜的办法不是再去拍 5000 张，而是把现有的 500 张翻转、裁剪、调色，变出几倍的训练样本。这就是数据增强：用保持标签不变的变换，从已有真实样本里榨出更多有效训练信号。它与下一章的合成数据有本质区别——增强改造的是真实样本，合成则凭空生成。本篇讲增强的原理、各模态手法与它修复的维度。它补的是 <a href=\"../foundations/data-quality\">数据质量与维度</a> 里的完整性与代表性维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据增强的根本前提是不变性 (invariance)：存在一类对样本的变换，变换后样本的语义标签不变。一张猫的照片水平翻转后仍是猫，一句话换个同义词仍是同样的情感。增强的本质，是把人类先验里「这些变换不改变标签」的知识，注入到训练数据中，等价于告诉模型「在这些方向上别太敏感」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模态</th>\n<th>常用增强</th>\n<th>保持的不变性</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图像</td>\n<td>翻转、裁剪、调色、旋转</td>\n<td>几何/光照不变性</td>\n<td>过度旋转改变语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文本</td>\n<td>回译、同义替换、随机删词</td>\n<td>语义不变性</td>\n<td>替换改变情感极性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音频</td>\n<td>加噪、变速、变调</td>\n<td>内容不变性</td>\n<td>变速过度损害可懂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>Mixup、CutMix</td>\n<td>标签线性可插值</td>\n<td>标签平滑过头</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>下图展示一个真实样本如何经增强管线膨胀为多个训练样本，以及不变性约束如何把关每一步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[单个真实样本 x, y] --&gt; B{选择增强策略}&#10;  B --&gt; C[几何变换&lt;br/&gt;翻转/裁剪/旋转]&#10;  B --&gt; D[语义变换&lt;br/&gt;回译/同义替换]&#10;  B --&gt; E[混合变换&lt;br/&gt;Mixup/CutMix]&#10;  C --&gt; F[标签保持 y 不变]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; G[标签按比例插值]&#10;  F --&gt; H[膨胀后的训练集]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[模型对这些方向更鲁棒]\">flowchart TD\n  A[单个真实样本 x, y] --&gt; B{选择增强策略}\n  B --&gt; C[几何变换&lt;br/&gt;翻转/裁剪/旋转]\n  B --&gt; D[语义变换&lt;br/&gt;回译/同义替换]\n  B --&gt; E[混合变换&lt;br/&gt;Mixup/CutMix]\n  C --&gt; F[标签保持 y 不变]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; G[标签按比例插值]\n  F --&gt; H[膨胀后的训练集]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[模型对这些方向更鲁棒]</pre><h2 id=\"不变性的边界-增强不是越多越好\">不变性的边界：增强不是越多越好</h2><p>新手最容易犯的错，是把增强强度调到极致，结果把标签也变没了。增强的核心约束恰恰是不变性的边界。</p>\n<p>举例：把手写数字图片旋转 15 度无伤大雅，但旋转 180 度会把 6 变成 9——标签变了，这条增强就成了噪声。文本里把「这部电影还行」做同义替换，若替换词改变了情感强度，标签就被破坏。因此每一种增强都隐含一个有效幅度区间，超出区间就从「教模型不变性」滑向「污染标签」。</p>\n<p>这把增强与 <a href=\"cleaning-debugging\">清洗与数据调试</a> 联系起来：过度增强产生的样本本质是带噪标签，会被置信学习当作错标揪出来。一个稳健做法是把增强强度当超参，用下游验证指标搜索，而非凭直觉拉满。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mixup-与混合类增强\">Mixup 与混合类增强</h2><p>几何与语义变换都在单个样本内部做文章，混合类增强则更激进——它跨样本插值，连标签一起插值。</p>\n<p>Mixup 取两个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x_i, y_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x_j, y_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，按系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 线性混合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{x} = \\lambda x_i + (1-\\lambda) x_j, \\quad \\tilde{y} = \\lambda y_i + (1-\\lambda) y_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 通常采自 Beta 分布。它训练模型在样本之间表现得线性平滑，能显著提升泛化与对抗鲁棒性。CutMix 则是把一个图片的一块区域贴到另一张上，标签按面积比例混合。这类方法之所以有效，是因为它们正则化了模型在数据流形之间的行为，而不只是在单点附近。</p>\n<p>混合类增强对代表性维度有微妙影响：它能在已有类别之间「填空」，缓解中间区域的样本稀疏，但无法凭空创造从未出现过的子群——后者只能靠重新采集或 <a href=\"../synthetic/synthetic-data\">合成数据</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增强-vs-合成-一条清晰的分界\">增强 vs 合成：一条清晰的分界</h2><p>本 hub 把增强与合成严格分开，理解这条分界能避免方法误用。</p>\n<p>增强的输入永远是真实样本，输出是真实样本的变体，它依赖的是「变换不改变标签」的人类先验，不引入新的语义内容。合成数据则不以任何具体真实样本为底，而是用生成模型按分布造出全新样本，能创造训练集里从未有过的组合。一句话：增强是真实数据的形变，合成是分布的采样。</p>\n<p>这条分界决定了适用场景。当真实样本充足但多样性不够（如各种角度的猫），用增强；当某类样本根本不存在或采集受限（如罕见病影像、隐私敏感数据），就需要 <a href=\"../synthetic/synthetic-data\">合成数据</a>。两者也常组合使用：先合成补足缺失子群，再增强提升每个样本的多样性。增强不背负合成那种「模型坍缩」的风险，因为它始终锚定在真实样本上。</p>\n<p>实践里，增强翻车的方式可以归成三类。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强度拉满</td>\n<td>只求「变出更多」，不设幅度上限</td>\n<td>变换越界，标签被污染</td>\n<td>把强度当超参，按下游指标搜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同法堆叠</td>\n<td>对每个样本套同一套变换</td>\n<td>多样性未增，只增冗余</td>\n<td>按模态与任务选择有意义的变换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增强代合成</td>\n<td>用增强硬补根本不存在的子群</td>\n<td>缺失子群始终缺席</td>\n<td>转用合成或补采真实样本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话判据：任何一个增强后样本，若人工看会给出不同标签，它就已经从「教不变性」滑成了「噪声」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数据增强用保持标签不变的变换从真实样本榨出更多训练信号，本质是把「这些变换不改标签」的人类先验注入数据。</li>\n<li>不变性有边界：旋转 6 成 9、同义替换改情感都会破坏标签，过度增强等于制造带噪样本，应把强度当超参搜索。</li>\n<li>Mixup/CutMix 跨样本线性插值并连标签一起插值，正则化模型在数据流形间的行为，提升泛化与鲁棒性。</li>\n<li>增强与合成有清晰分界：增强是真实样本的形变、不引入新语义，合成是分布采样、能造出全新组合。</li>\n<li>本篇补的是完整性与代表性维度，但只能丰富已有子群；创造缺失子群需转向下一章的合成数据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据增强","id":"数据增强"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"不变性的边界：增强不是越多越好","id":"不变性的边界-增强不是越多越好"},{"level":2,"text":"Mixup 与混合类增强","id":"mixup-与混合类增强"},{"level":2,"text":"增强 vs 合成：一条清晰的分界","id":"增强-vs-合成-一条清晰的分界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"清洗与数据调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-centric-ai/curation/cleaning-debugging"},"next":{"title":"合成数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-centric-ai/synthetic/synthetic-data"}}